polarbear:{c:{eyeOne:"soft blue",markings:"a polar bear tattoo across one shoulder"},
  blurb:"Her big, gentle match: a towering, broad-shouldered fisherman with a thick blond beard, soft blue eyes, a hairy chest and a polar bear tattoo across one shoulder, who carries her across the snow when her feet get cold. Flannel and jeans, a henley with rolled sleeves, or shirtless."},
