beluga:{c:{eyeOne:"ice blue",markings:"a beluga tattoo winding down one forearm"},
  blurb:"Her dangerously handsome conductor: tall, lean and devastatingly cool, with a slicked-back ash-blond undercut, piercing ice-blue eyes, designer stubble and a beluga tattoo down one forearm, who has conducted every concert she has sung in. An open-collared tuxedo, a leather jacket, or nothing."},
ermine:{c:{eyeOne:"dark brown",markings:"a crown tattoo over his heart"},
  blurb:"Her devoted consort: a towering, golden-skinned bodyguard with loose black waves, calm dark eyes, light stubble and a crown tattoo over his heart, who has never once told her no. An open white linen shirt and gold chain, or swim trunks."},
puffin:{c:{eyeOne:"green",markings:"a puffin tattoo on one forearm"},
  blurb:"Her partner in pranks: a lean, charming street performer with a side-swept undercut, laughing green eyes, a short beard, a single hoop earring and a puffin tattoo on one forearm. Waistcoat and rolled sleeves, an open shirt, or nothing."},
seahorse:{c:{eyeOne:"warm brown",markings:"two little seahorses tattooed over his heart"},
  blurb:"Her devoted sweetheart: a tall, broad-shouldered marine biologist with soft tousled waves, warm brown eyes, freckles, light stubble and two seahorses tattooed over his heart, who writes her a love letter every single morning. A cream cable-knit sweater, a henley with an apron, an open shirt, or nothing."},
manta:{c:{eyeOne:"gray",markings:"a manta ray tattoo spread across his chest and shoulders"},
  blurb:"Her deep-sea diver: a towering, broad-shouldered free-diver with long black hair slicked back into a low ponytail, calm gray eyes, rugged stubble, a lazy smile and a manta ray tattoo across his chest and shoulders."},
koi:{c:{eyeOne:"warm brown",markings:"a koi tattoo swimming up one forearm"},
  blurb:"Her garden-keeper: a tall, lean landscape gardener with a jet-black textured crop, warm brown eyes, light stubble and a koi tattoo up one forearm, who built her the pond and feeds the fish with her every morning. A crisp white shirt and apron, an indigo jacket over a black shirt, or nothing."},
eel:{c:{eyeOne:"electric blue",markings:"a lightning-bolt tattoo across his chest"},
  blurb:"The only man who can keep up with her: tall, cold and immaculate, with slicked-back black hair, startling blue eyes, a knowing smirk and a lightning-bolt tattoo across his chest. A black suit and silver tie, a silk shirt open to the chest, or less."},
